# Python environments and caches
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.coverage
**/htmlcov/

# JavaScript and desktop build output
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/release/
**/.vite/

# Local UI and browser evidence (selected public screenshots live in docs/assets)
**/.playwright-cli/
**/output/
**/test-results/
**/playwright-report/

# Local databases and runtime state
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3
**/*.sqlite3-*
**/*.db
**/*.db-*

# Generated experiment artifacts. Source fixtures and manifests remain tracked.
**/artifacts/runs/
**/artifacts/reports/
**/artifacts/rejected/
**/artifacts/archives/
**/artifacts/latest.json
**/artifacts/lab-report.json
**/artifacts/lab-report.md
**/artifacts/acceptance-report.md
**/artifacts/quick-latest.json
**/artifacts/quick-lab-report.json
**/artifacts/quick-lab-report.md
**/artifacts/checkpoints/
!**/artifacts/.gitkeep

# Local packaging, logs and operating-system files
**/*.log
**/*.exe
**/*.msi
**/*.zip
**/*.7z
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Environment files and secrets
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*credentials*.json
**/*secret*.json
**/*.pfx
**/*.p12
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.jks
**/*.keystore
**/.npmrc
**/.netrc
**/.pypirc
**/id_rsa
**/id_rsa.*
